  "title": "Grilled Garlic and Rosemary Lamb Loin Chops",
  "description": "For this grilled garlic and rosemary lamb loin chops recipe, lamb loin chops marinate in a garlic, rosemary, and Dijon mustard then cook on a hot grill.",
